@Appointment_HostAddress = http://localhost:4002
@accessToken = replace-with-a-bearer-token
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List upcoming appointments
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments?upcoming=true&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List past appointments, most recent first
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments?upcoming=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List without a token (401)
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Accept: application/json

### Get one appointment
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get someone else's appointment (404, never 403)
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Book an appointment (201)
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quarterly review",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-14T09:30:00+02:00",
  "location": "Head office, boardroom 2",
  "notes": "Bring the Q3 figures."
}

### Book with a blank title (400)
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-14T09:30:00+02:00"
}

### Book with no scheduledAt (400)
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing time"
}

### Replace an appointment (200; a source-linked or someone else's row is 404)
PUT {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quarterly review (moved)",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-15T09:30:00+02:00"
}

### Delete an appointment (204; a source-linked or someone else's row is 404)
DELETE {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Staff (appointments.manage): every diary, in the staff shape, or one with userId
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments?userId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Search by one field of the caller's shape. userEmail is staff only: 400 for a member
GET {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments?field=userEmail&keyword=example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Staff book in another account's diary (201). 403 for a member naming anyone else
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Onboarding call",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-20T09:30:00+02:00",
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Create three independently editable monthly appointments (January 31, February 28, March 31)
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Monthly review","scheduledAt":"2030-01-31T09:00:00Z","repeat":"Monthly","occurrences":3}

### Invalid repeat bounds: 400, no appointments created
POST {{Appointment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Too many","scheduledAt":"2030-01-31T09:00:00Z","repeat":"Daily","occurrences":101}
